ob name sketch to name text verify prompt be plus do

ob name using tools from num 1 be equally then ob text of ob of verify prompt for name verifier with name tools map be evoke do
ob name using tools from num 1 be tiny then ob text of ob of verify prompt for name verifier be evoke do
ob name result to name text reaction be text do

ob name reaction atmost num 1 to name text decision line be line tail do
ob text "FAIL" to name text verify loop decision be text do
ob num 0 to name num verify loop score be plus do
ob name decision line from text "/^\\s*PASS\\b/i" be resemble then ob text "PASS" to name text verify loop decision be text do
ob name decision line from text "/^\\s*PASS\\b/i" be resemble then ob num 1 to name num verify loop score be plus do
ob name decision line from text "/^\\s*PASS\\b/i" be resemble then be depart do
ob name decision line from text "/^\\s*FAIL\\b/i" be resemble then be depart do
ob name decision line from text "/^\\s*[01](?:\\.\\d+)?\\s*$/" be resemble then ob name decision line from num 0 to num 1 become name num to name num verify loop score be cast do
ob name decision line from text "/^\\s*[01](?:\\.\\d+)?\\s*$/" be resemble then ob name verify loop score from name verify threshold be tiny then be depart do
ob name decision line from text "/^\\s*[01](?:\\.\\d+)?\\s*$/" be resemble then ob text "PASS" to name text verify loop decision be text do
ob name decision line from text "/^\\s*[01](?:\\.\\d+)?\\s*$/" be resemble then be depart do
